   "lines": [
    "I find that my",
    "recitations, lectures",
    "and labratory",
    "work will occupy",
    "about 20 hours a",
    "week. I have a",
    "recitation every",
    "day, including",
    "Saturday, at 9 a.m.",
    "Harry Shaw and",
    "Dick Saltonstall",
    "both asked me to",
    "spend tomorrow",
    "with them. Our",
    "club table is at",
    "Mrs Wilsons, where the",
    "food, service & atten-",
    "dance are excellent."
   ],
